e oko", "en": "so agree on", "tr": "öyleyse anlaşın", "fr": "alors accordez-vous sur", "id": "maka sepakatilah", "ur": "پس تم متفق ہو جاؤ", "bn": "তোমরা একমত হও", "fa": "پس بر (کاری) توافق کنید"}}, {"text": "كَيْدَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱئْتُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَفًّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَقَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَفْلَحَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْيَوْمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱسْتَعْلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "فَأَجْمِعُوٓا۟", "count": 1, "first": "10:71", "audio": "audio/0fd5fbb643c5ab718e7d.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "so (you all) resolve!", "bs": "pa odlučite!", "tr": "böylece karar verin!", "fr": "alors décidez !", "id": "maka putuskanlah kalian!", "ur": "پس عزم کرو!", "bn": "অতএব সংকল্প কর!", "fa": "پس تصمیم بگیرید!"}}, {"arabic": "وَأَجْمَعُوٓا۟", "count": 1, "first": "12:15", "audio": "audio/6211ccedf3176f17b489.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and they resolved", "bs": "i odlučili su", "tr": "ve karar verdiler", "fr": "et ils ont décidé", "id": "dan mereka telah memutuskan", "ur": "اور انہوں نے عزم کیا", "bn": "এবং তারা সংকল্প করল", "fa": "و تصمیم گرفتند"}}, {"arabic": "أَجْمَعُوٓا۟", "count": 1, "first": "12:102", "audio": "audio/622f5a2091675b5edaba.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "they resolved", "bs": "odlučili su", "tr": "karar verdiler", "fr": "ils ont décidé", "id": "mereka telah memutuskan", "ur": "انہوں نے عزم کیا", "bn": "তারা সংকল্প করল", "fa": "تصمیم گرفتند"}}, {"arabic": "فَأَجْمِعُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "20:64", "audio": "audio/52f18c56590d58c24f44.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "pa se dogovorite oko", "en": "so agree on", "tr": "böylece üzerinde anlaşın", "fr": "alors mettez-vous d'accord sur", "id": "maka bersepakatlah kalian", "ur": "پس اتفاق کرو!", "bn": "অতএব একমত হও", "fa": "پس درباره ... توافق کنید"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0514.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0514.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0514.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0514.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0514.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "الْعُلَمَاءُ أَجْمَعُوا عَلَى الرَّأْيِ", "spoken": "audio/f42e1596ff786f2f1cdc.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "translation": {"bs": "Učenjaci su se jednoglasno složili oko mišljenja.", "en": "The scholars agreed unanimously on the opinion.", "bn": "আলিমগণ মতামতের বিষয়ে সর্বসম্মতভাবে একমত হয়েছেন।", "fa": "دانشمندان به اتفاق بر سر این رأی توافق کردند.", "fr": "Les savants se sont mis d'accord à l'unanimité sur l'avis.", "id": "Para ulama itu sepakat dengan suara bulat atas pendapat itu.", "tr": "Âlimler bu görüş üzerinde oybirliğiyle anlaştılar.", "ur": "علماء اس رائے پر متفق ہو گئے۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "الْعُلَمَاءُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "učenjaci", "en": "the scholars", "bn": "আলিমগণ", "fa": "دانشمندان", "fr": "les savants", "id": "para ulama itu", "tr": "âlimler", "ur": "علماء"}}, {"arabic": "أَجْمَعُوا", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "složili su se jednoglasno", "en": "agreed unanimously", "bn": "সর্বসম্মতভাবে একমত হয়েছে", "fa": "متفق شدند", "fr": "se sont mis d'accord à l'unanimité", "id": "mereka sepakat dengan suara bulat", "tr": "oybirliğiyle anlaştılar", "ur": "متفق ہوئے"}}, {"arabic": "عَلَى", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "oko", "en": "on", "bn": "উপর", "fa": "بر", "fr": "sur", "id": "di atas", "tr": "üzerinde", "ur": "پر"}}, {"arabic": "الرَّأْيِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "mišljenja", "en": "the opinion", "bn": "মতামতের", "fa": "رأی", "fr": "l'avis", "id": "pendapat itu", "tr": "görüş", "ur": "رائے"}}]}, {"arabic": "أَجْمِعُوا عَلَى خُطَّةٍ وَاحِدَةٍ", "spoken": "audio/3a86f574b42b8d69189f.m4a", "tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "translation": {"bs": "Složite se oko jednog plana.", "en": "Agree on one plan.", "bn": "একটি পরিকল্পনায় একমত হও।", "fa": "بر یک نقشه متفق شوید.", "fr": "Mettez-vous d'accord sur un seul plan.", "id": "Sepakatilah satu rencana.", "tr": "Tek bir plan üzerinde anlaşın.", "ur": "ایک ہی منصوبے پر متفق ہو جاؤ۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "أَجْمِعُوا", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "složite se", "en": "agree", "bn": "একমত হও", "fa": "متفق شوید", "fr": "mettez-vous d'accord", "id": "sepakatilah", "tr": "anlaşın", "ur": "متفق ہو جاؤ"}}, {"arabic": "عَلَى", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "oko", "en": "on", "bn": "উপর", "fa": "بر", "fr": "sur", "id": "di atas", "tr": "üzerinde", "ur": "پر"}}, {"arabic": "خُطَّةٍ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "plana", "en": "a plan", "bn": "একটি পরিকল্পনা", "fa": "نقشه‌ای", "fr": "un plan", "id": "sebuah rencana", "tr": "bir plan", "ur": "منصوبہ"}}, {"arabic": "وَاحِدَةٍ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "jednog", "en": "one", "bn": "একটি", "fa": "یکی", "fr": "un", "id": "satu", "tr": "bir", "ur": "ایک"}}]}]}